WEBVTT


1
00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:03.360
In Estonia, we have a legal requirement to install smoke

2
00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:07.480
alarms in all domestic homes since 1st of July 2009 because

3
00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.280
sadly, this is where the most of the five fatalities were

4
00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:14.160
occurring. This law has resulted in a big reduction in fire

5
00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:16.320
fatalities in domestic homes since then.

6
00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:19.280
It has made a huge difference here in Estonia.

7
00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:23.080
We encourage more EU countries to follow our lead and to

8
00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:24.840
install smoke alarms today.